Changes 2022–2026:
*May 2022: Andy Gibbons (Labour) dies – by-election held July 2022<ref>{{cite web |title=Tributes paid to long serving Tooting councillor Andy Gibbons |url=https://www.wandsworth.gov.uk/news/2022-news/news-may-2022/tributes-paid-to-long-serving-tooting-councillor-andy-gibbons/ |website=Wandsworth Borough Council |access-date=22 January 2026 |language=en-gb}}</ref>
*July 2022: Rex Osborn (Labour) wins by-election<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project — Tooting Broadway Ward |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/ward/22109/#2022-07-14 |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*November 2023: Kate Forbes (Labour) resigns – by-election held January 2024<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=Never have happened in Sir Robin’s day |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2023/11/never-have-happened-in-sir-robins-day/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*January 2024: Sean Lawless (Labour) wins by-election<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project — Tooting Broadway Ward |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/ward/22109/#2022-07-14 |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*March 2024: Claire Gilbert (Labour) resigns – by-election held May 2024<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=In like Flintshire |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2024/03/in-like-flintshire/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*May 2024: Nick Austin (Conservative) gains by-election from Labour<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project — West Putney Ward |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/ward/22115/#2024-05-02 |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*July 2025: Nick Austin (Conservative) leaves party to sit as an independent<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=Conservative winds shake the Barleythorpe |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2025/07/conservative-winds-shake-the-barleythorpe/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=22 January 2026}}</ref>
*August 2025: Mark Justin (Conservative) joins Reform<ref>{{cite news |last1=Lillywhite |first1=Charlotte |title=Another London Tory defects to Reform as party grows without elections |url=https://www.mylondon.news/news/south-london-news/another-london-tory-defects-reform-32251316 |access-date=22 January 2026 |work=My London |date=12 August 2025 |language=en}}</ref>

